msgid ""
"Note: The perf command can be built without building the kernel in the "
"repository and can be run on older kernels. However matching the kernel and "
"perf revisions gives more accurate information on the subsystem usage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../admin-guide/workload-tracing.rst:236
msgid ""
"We used \"perf stat\" and \"perf bench\" options. For a detailed information "
"on the perf tool, run \"perf -h\"."
